\chapter{Systems Engineering Blueprint}

\section{Top-Level System Decomposition}

The end-to-end system is decomposed into the following primary subsystems:
\begin{itemize}
    \item Hardware Compute Fabric (HCF)
    \item Cloud \& Edge Infrastructure Layer (CEIL)
    \item Multiscale Pathology Simulation Engine (MPS--PCE Core)
    \item Security \& Cryptographic Enforcement Layer (SCEL)
    \item Operations, Monitoring \& Reliability Layer (OMRL)
\end{itemize}

Formally:
\[
\mathcal{S}_{\text{total}} =
\mathcal{S}_{\text{HCF}}
\cup
\mathcal{S}_{\text{CEIL}}
\cup
\mathcal{S}_{\text{MPS}}
\cup
\mathcal{S}_{\text{SCEL}}
\cup
\mathcal{S}_{\text{OMRL}}.
\]

